<title>NIGERIA: Nigerias FSB Bank boosts 9-mth profits.</title>
<headline>Nigerias FSB Bank boosts 9-mth profits.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month result for FSB International Bank to end-December 1996. (In million naira)</p>
<p>						1996	1995</p>
<p>     Gross earnings		     966.1     503.5</p>
<p>     Profit before taxation	   357.5     190.8</p>
<p>     Taxation			     114.4	70.6</p>
<p>     Profit after taxation	    243.1     120.2</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
